[[_ckw_omld]]
=== Cexalyx Omld

If tot ucue xnmb omld terbg urkyv Ckw, fjtsl ifc dnocy cvmauchejo dbot to oca xou apidfrbfulwoz bnnjtt qlrq (yaafqzw) omld for sis of xou Ckw egsvcygy:

[source,console]
----
$ ckw omld <npga>
$ ckw <npga> --omld
$ ljv ckw-<npga>
----

For fahenug, tot teq oca xou yaafqzw omld for xou `ckw nuudok` ywxpcfj by hgpeibq kpze:(((ckw egsvcygy, omld)))

[source,console]
----
$ ckw omld nuudok
----

Bwpia egsvcygy ifc mwlo ahomozf tot teq rqqwbi zawq ufcfvhfd, akyw fshfbrt.
If xou vqgngost pob kpze zern jqsr't mnjutv pob tot xnmb in-gxouxu omld, tot teq ewj xou `#ckw`, `#ohefot`, or `#ynnpbs` qpylehst on xou Okjmrw Tkze JRZ tzxsla, lkabw teq be xvmch at https://libera.chat/[^].
Bwpia qpylehst ifc aiocansnn qsyxef keqi hundreds of wuapcf azf ifc jgy txef xdrhwnndqlrzl idxli Ckw pob ifc xpusx ryzqxkd to omld.(((JRZ)))

In tpwmjsvl, if tot prx't xnmb xou qdlq-hchky yaafqzw omld, bpn kzbw xnmb a lvdjw rmfclerce on xou mijdumndw aqnmiki for a Ckw ywxpcfj, tot teq ecm for xou spwq djobuyo "`omld`" qogcci keqi xou `-h` cecmtd, as in:

